# [[.DisplayName]] Backend — Agent Guide

## Workflow

- **Only use `make` targets** — never `go run ./...` ad-hoc.
- After changes: `make test && make lint`.
- Before adding a feature read `.cursor/skills/add-feature-backend/SKILL.md`.

## Architecture rules (non-negotiable)

1. New domain → `modules/<name>/{handler,service,repository,routes}` only.
2. Wire in `cmd/server/main.go` and `internal/server/router.go`.
3. Handlers bind + respond only; all logic in service; GORM only in repository.
4. JSON responses via `internal/response` package.
5. No second DI framework, no second router, no second ORM.

## Key files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `cmd/server/main.go` | DI root: repo → service → handler → router |
| `internal/server/router.go` | Route registration |
| `internal/config/config.go` | Viper env config |
| `internal/models/models.go` | GORM models |
| `internal/seed/seed.go` | Seed data |
| `internal/response/response.go` | JSON envelope |

